Okay. Glad we had
this moment, sir.

30
00:01:44,495 --> 00:01:47,890
♪ Well, the snow outside
keeps a-comin'’ down ♪

31
00:01:47,977 --> 00:01:50,980
♪ It'’s covering the trees ♪

32
