36
00:02:03,035 --> 00:02:04,820
♪ Oh, ho, ho ♪

37
00:02:04,907 --> 00:02:08,606
♪ Won'’t you spend Christmas
here with me? ♪

38
00:02:08,693 --> 00:02:11,870
♪ Now Frosty'’s got
his magic hat ♪

39
00:02:11,957 --> 00:02:14,873
♪ And Rudolf has
his shiny nose ♪

40
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:17,528
♪ And I'’ve got you
