41
00:02:17,615 --> 00:02:19,791
♪ While they'’re stuck
in the snow ♪

42
00:02:19,878 --> 00:02:22,794
♪ And I say ho, ho, ho ♪

43
00:02:22,881 --> 00:02:24,970
♪ Won'’t you spend
Christmas here ♪

44
00:02:25,057 --> 00:02:26,972
♪ Spend Christmas
here with me? ♪

45
00:02:27,059 --> 00:02:28,800
WOMAN: At the end of the day,

46
00:02:28,887 --> 00:02:31,107
