69
00:03:34,039 --> 00:03:35,127
Tan-colored.

70
00:03:35,215 --> 00:03:39,088
T-Tan milkshake.
Yes, sir.

71
00:03:40,524 --> 00:03:42,613
Oh, when you'’re done here,

72
00:03:42,700 --> 00:03:44,615
