- No.

251
00:11:16,980 --> 00:11:18,329
I'’m not going there
for the cheese.

252
00:11:18,416 --> 00:11:20,636
I'’m gonna liquidate
a failing company.

253
00:11:20,723 --> 00:11:24,248
And if I do a good job,
