to try my new flavor.

510
00:23:44,814 --> 00:23:45,989
Yeah, sure.

511
00:23:50,820 --> 00:23:52,866
Mmm, Wendy...

512
00:23:52,953 --> 00:23:54,389
that'’s a winner.

513
00:24:00,917 --> 00:24:03,180
