558
00:26:11,700 --> 00:26:13,267
- Been with us a long time.
- Mm-hmm.

559
00:26:13,354 --> 00:26:15,574
- Since, uh--
- Well, since him.

560
00:26:15,661 --> 00:26:17,750
Well, we were younger then.

561
00:26:17,837 --> 00:26:19,752
