1367
01:06:29,855 --> 01:06:32,336
♪ Oh, love ♪

1368
01:06:32,423 --> 01:06:36,949
♪ Come on, let'’s find a way ♪

1369
01:06:37,036 --> 01:06:42,476
♪ I'’ll paint you a sky
full of rainbows ♪

1370
01:06:42,563 --> 01:06:45,523
♪ Come on, let'’s find a way ♪

